   Hospitals & Healthcare
   UZ Leuven/Nexuzhealth Web PACS/Detail
   Detail Updates Leaderboard
   Description

   This website is used to provide patient access to their radiology images
   (PACS). Patients logon with their date of birth, and a unique code
   provided to them by the physician. This code provides access to one study.

